{
  "$comment": "Golden corpus for the article dialect. 'canonical' files must be fixed points of the TipTap normalizer. Non-canonical files list the syntax-only normalization categories (see docs/v2/article-dialect.md, 'Normalization') that the first normalization is expected to apply, as detected by comparing markdown-it token streams. normalized/<file> holds the reviewed TipTap output for every file.",
